+
+## 10. TargetPricingClient (Dependency-Injected)
+
+```python
+class TargetPricingClient(Protocol):
+    """Interface for Target pricing API calls. DI'd for testability."""
+
+    async def update_price(
+        self,
+        seller_id: str,
+        product_id: str,
+        list_price: Decimal,
+        offer_price: Decimal | None,
+        map_price: Decimal | None,
+    ) -> PriceUpdateResult: ...
+```
+
+- **Production:** `HttpTargetPricingClient` — wraps `httpx.AsyncClient`, sends PUT to Target API
+- **Test:** `MockTargetPricingClient` — returns canned responses, records calls for assertion
+- **Local dev:** same mock, or `respx` route matching for integration tests
+- **Zero production calls:** test suite asserts no outbound HTTP to `api.target.com` or `stage-api.target.com`
+
+### Base URL Configuration
+
+| Environment | `TARGET_API_BASE_URL` |
