+- [x] **Throttling strategy:** Token bucket in worker; sleep `1/PRICING_RATE_LIMIT_RPS` seconds between PUTs.
+- [x] **429 retry:** Honor `Retry-After` header if present; else exponential backoff (base 2s, max 5 retries).
+- [x] **Expected throughput:** At 1 req/s, 1000 items drain in ~17 minutes. 10,000 items in ~2.8 hours.
+- [x] **Background processing:** Yes — queue worker runs as background task. Enqueue endpoint returns 202 immediately.
